      <link>https://www.iwbeacon.com/news-post/win-a-pair-of-adult-tickets-to-the-three-rivers-music-festival</link>
      <description>The Three Rivers Music Festival returns to the Isle of Wight this May half term for its biggest year yet, bringing three days of music, creativity, wellness and community to the beautiful rural setting of Durrants Farm, Porchfield - and we're offering you the chance to bag a pair of adult tickets! Now in its third year, Three Rivers has quickly become one of the Island’s most loved independent festivals – known for its relaxed, friendly atmosphere, diverse line-up and strong family focus....</description>
